{
  "id": "E385",
  "title": "Big Brain Hole",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-12-15",
  "synopsis": "How do you describe a person who has a vivid imagination?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50385/2d4c8d776d1b57ba493af37ffe3acb96f0ee1b94.mp3?1575901970",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "脑洞很大\n\n保罗：我写了个小故事，你看看有意思吗？\n小乐：哈哈哈，你的“脑洞”也太大了！\n保罗：我的“脑洞”？我的脑子没有洞……\n小乐：我说你的“脑洞”很大，意思是你很有想象力。\n保罗：那你是在夸我吧？\n小乐：是啊，你写的故事很有意思！多写几个发到网上，一定会火的。\n",
    "traditional": "腦洞很大\n\n保羅：我寫了個小故事，你看看有意思嗎？\n小樂：哈哈哈，你的“腦洞”也太大了！\n保羅：我的“腦洞”？我的腦子沒有洞……\n小樂：我說你的“腦洞”很大，意思是你很有想像力。\n保羅：那你是在誇我吧？\n小樂：是啊，你寫的故事很有意思！多寫幾個發到網上，一定會火的。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Having a Big “Brain Hole”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：我写了个小故事，你看看有意思吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：我寫了個小故事，你看看有意思嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ xiě le ge xiǎo gù shi nǐ kàn kan yǒu yì si ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I wrote a small story! Have a look, do you think it’s funny?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：哈哈哈，你的“脑洞”也太大了！",
      "traditional": "小樂：哈哈哈，你的“腦洞”也太大了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hā hā hā nǐ de nǎo dòng yě tài dà le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Hahaha, your “brain hole” is so big!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：我的“脑洞”？我的脑子没有洞……",
      "traditional": "保羅：我的“腦洞”？我的腦子沒有洞……",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ de nǎo dòng wǒ de nǎo zi méi yǒu dòng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: My “brain hole”? My brain doesn't have a hole…"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：我说你的“脑洞”很大，意思是你很有想象力。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我說你的“腦洞”很大，意思是你很有想像力。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ shuō nǐ de nǎo dòng hěn dà yì si shì nǐ hěn yǒu xiǎng xiàng lì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I said your “brain hole” is very big, it means that you have a very powerful imagination."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：那你是在夸我吧？",
      "traditional": "保羅：那你是在誇我吧？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà nǐ shì zài kuā wǒ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then you were praising me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：是啊，你写的故事很有意思！",
      "traditional": "小樂：是啊，你寫的故事很有意思！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè shì a nǐ xiě de gù shi hěn yǒu yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "多写几个发到网上，一定会火的。",
      "traditional": "多寫幾個發到網上，一定會火的。",
      "pinyin": "duō xiě jǐ ge fā dào wǎng shang yí dìng huì huǒ de",
      "english": "Little Le: Yes, the story you wrote is very funny!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Write a few more and post them online, they’ll definitely become popular."
    }
  ],
